WEBVTT

00:01.460 --> 00:04.570
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:04.570 --> 00:08.200
Omoi wa kouya o yuku

00:08.200 --> 00:16.130
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

00:21.280 --> 00:27.790
Yaketsuku hizashi no moto kimi wa nani omou?

00:27.790 --> 00:33.730
Urei no hitomi wa ima nani o utsusu?

00:33.730 --> 00:42.670
Mayowazu ni irareru no nara
step by step tayasui darou

00:42.670 --> 00:47.440
Kaze no you ni

00:47.440 --> 00:50.510
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:50.510 --> 00:54.120
Akatsuki no kouya o yuku

00:54.120 --> 01:00.560
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

01:00.560 --> 01:07.360
Don't be afraid kawaru koto wa
osoreru koto ja nai

01:07.360 --> 01:13.470
Kimi ga kimi de aru naraba will be with you

01:13.470 --> 01:20.210
Odayaka na hi o yume-mite

01:20.210 --> 01:27.440
Michi-naki tabiji wa tsuzuku

01:44.670 --> 01:47.140
It's no use...

01:47.140 --> 01:49.370
It's not making me feel better at all.

01:51.810 --> 01:55.170
It's still just unforgivable...

01:58.180 --> 02:02.140
Being so friendly with my Ellis...

02:05.320 --> 02:06.860
Have you caught a cold?

02:06.860 --> 02:10.130
Nah, somebody's probably talking about me.

02:10.130 --> 02:13.800
"Hey, have you heard? There's this
drop dead gorgeous bounty hunter."

02:13.800 --> 02:15.400
"Oh, I've heard! I've heard!

02:15.400 --> 02:18.630
She's apparently got an awesome
figure and one sharp mind."

02:18.630 --> 02:23.510
"Man, just once in my life,
I'd love to run into a woman like that!"

02:23.510 --> 02:25.740
- Then chop these apart.
- Huh?

02:25.740 --> 02:27.730
With your sharp mind.

02:30.750 --> 02:33.870
Wh-What the? What happened here?

02:36.420 --> 02:38.440
Unforgivable...

02:48.500 --> 02:53.900
And then, L.A. let his libido overtake him...

03:12.950 --> 03:16.390
- What did they say?
- L.A.'s here.

03:16.390 --> 03:19.360
There seems to have been
some trouble last night.

03:19.360 --> 03:20.800
What happened?

03:20.800 --> 03:23.400
I don't even want to talk
about it, so don't make me.

03:23.400 --> 03:24.570
I see.

03:24.570 --> 03:26.670
Come on, let's go look for an inn.

03:26.670 --> 03:29.500
If it's a place to stay, you needn't worry.

03:29.500 --> 03:31.410
We'd like you to come with us.

03:31.410 --> 03:33.540
Huh? Why?

03:33.540 --> 03:36.740
Come quietly with us and we
won't have to do anything to you.

03:36.740 --> 03:38.350
What if we say we don't want to?

03:38.350 --> 03:40.910
We'll charge you with police obstruction, too.

03:48.720 --> 03:50.490
Hold it right there!

03:54.460 --> 03:56.600
- Nadie!
- Go on ahead!

03:56.600 --> 03:58.790
- But...
- Quickly!

04:03.710 --> 04:06.400
- Nadie...
- Ow, that hurt...

04:08.680 --> 04:11.450
Ellis...

04:11.450 --> 04:13.710
Ellis, no! Go!

04:21.820 --> 04:24.590
She's awfully quick on her feet...

04:52.890 --> 04:58.660
Hey, can't you be more gentle?
I'm a lady, you know.

04:58.660 --> 05:00.730
Don't make me laugh.

05:00.730 --> 05:04.070
What a dirty gun.
When's the last time you cleaned it?

05:04.070 --> 05:05.970
Give it back.

05:05.970 --> 05:09.630
We've been told that killing you
would be of little consequence.

05:10.840 --> 05:12.700
You've been told?

05:14.910 --> 05:18.680
But no matter how it looks,
I'm a gentleman, you see.

05:18.680 --> 05:20.520
You should thank God for that.

05:20.520 --> 05:23.640
Besides, I don't want any more
trouble than we've already got.

05:47.540 --> 05:49.570
Someone's instructing them...

05:54.050 --> 05:55.850
How boring.

05:55.850 --> 05:57.550
So you didn't kill her...

05:57.550 --> 05:59.490
I am not you!

06:00.960 --> 06:03.080
Such weak creatures...

06:13.400 --> 06:16.540
Once we capture that girl,
we'll hand her over to you.

06:16.540 --> 06:20.070
And then we want you to leave
town, just like you promised!

06:20.070 --> 06:22.440
Think you're playing the champion of justice?

06:22.440 --> 06:24.810
We'll also forget about what you did.

06:24.810 --> 06:28.150
With you gone, this town will go back to normal.

06:28.150 --> 06:30.140
Do I scare you?

06:35.820 --> 06:37.660
Hey, how's it going?

06:37.660 --> 06:39.490
I still haven't found her.

06:39.490 --> 06:41.630
I'll let you know if she turns up over here.

06:41.630 --> 06:43.830
Roger that.

06:43.830 --> 06:45.920
But why...

06:49.870 --> 06:51.860
...us?

07:03.620 --> 07:06.490
Ellis belongs only to me.

07:33.820 --> 07:35.810
Don't.

07:37.850 --> 07:39.650
Where are you going?

07:39.650 --> 07:41.620
To rescue Nadie.

07:41.620 --> 07:45.060
How? She's in jail.

07:45.060 --> 07:46.990
I'll manage somehow.

07:46.990 --> 07:49.530
It's impossible to do it now.

07:49.530 --> 07:52.030
- I'm going.
- Wait a little longer.

07:52.030 --> 07:54.760
Once the sun sets, I'll go check things out...

07:58.210 --> 08:00.940
Ellis...

08:00.940 --> 08:02.930
I'm going to save her.

08:05.580 --> 08:08.680
Because she's always saving me.

08:08.680 --> 08:12.090
I understand how you feel, but...

08:12.090 --> 08:15.960
I've never done anything for her.

08:15.960 --> 08:18.190
You're the one they're after.

08:23.060 --> 08:24.760
I'm going.

08:30.770 --> 08:32.240
Lirio...

08:35.780 --> 08:37.650
All right.

08:37.650 --> 08:39.880
I'll wait a bit longer.

08:53.630 --> 08:54.960
Shall we make our move?

08:54.960 --> 08:57.990
No, we'll wait and see for a while.

09:20.220 --> 09:24.250
She's... growing...

09:33.870 --> 09:35.340
Melissa.

09:35.340 --> 09:37.940
Have you seen the keys?

09:37.940 --> 09:40.170
Keys? Oh, to the car?

09:40.170 --> 09:44.630
Yes, I thought I'd left them here...

09:46.010 --> 09:48.350
- Is this it?
- Melissa.

09:48.350 --> 09:52.790
I have magical powers, you know.

09:52.790 --> 09:56.190
The truth is, so do I.

09:56.190 --> 10:01.060
I know. For some reason,
I can never lie to you.

10:01.060 --> 10:02.930
That's the way it should be.

10:02.930 --> 10:05.170
I love you, Doug.

10:05.170 --> 10:06.860
Melissa...

10:21.320 --> 10:25.350
Dinner! Hey!

10:25.350 --> 10:30.730
Bastards... My stomach and back
are about to meet up in the middle...

10:30.730 --> 10:33.360
Dinner!

10:33.360 --> 10:38.100
Ooh, it doesn't hurt anymore.

10:38.100 --> 10:41.300
Hey! Dinner!

10:46.870 --> 10:49.210
Nadie.

10:49.210 --> 10:50.950
Ricardo?

10:50.950 --> 10:52.380
We're getting you out.

10:52.380 --> 10:54.980
What about Ellis? Is she all right?

10:54.980 --> 10:56.380
Don't worry.

10:56.380 --> 10:58.990
I see. Thank goodness.

10:58.990 --> 11:00.720
She wants to save you.

11:00.720 --> 11:04.860
- What?
- That's what she said.

11:04.860 --> 11:06.160
Don't let her do anything reckless.

11:06.160 --> 11:07.860
I know.

11:07.860 --> 11:10.670
She's too honest to a fault.

11:10.670 --> 11:12.870
You are, too.

11:12.870 --> 11:14.740
You two make a good pair.

11:14.740 --> 11:18.070
Is that a compliment or an insult?

11:18.070 --> 11:19.970
Both.

11:19.970 --> 11:22.000
A good pair, huh?

11:27.080 --> 11:29.380
With my Ellis...

11:32.150 --> 11:34.140
A good pair?!

11:35.890 --> 11:37.290
No clues, huh?

11:37.290 --> 11:38.990
No...

11:41.100 --> 11:43.090
You humans...

11:46.000 --> 11:47.930
...are so dull.

12:25.470 --> 12:27.240
- This is our chance.
- Not yet.

12:27.240 --> 12:29.480
But...

12:29.480 --> 12:31.410
Not yet.

12:33.350 --> 12:36.380
All right, let's go.

12:36.380 --> 12:39.890
- Ellis?
- It's hot...

12:39.890 --> 12:43.850
Without Nadie, it's hot...

12:45.830 --> 12:47.320
It's hot...

12:57.170 --> 12:59.870
- L.A. is at the jail.
- What?

13:25.500 --> 13:27.570
Nadie...

13:27.570 --> 13:29.300
L. A...

13:43.020 --> 13:45.120
Why?

13:45.120 --> 13:49.590
I thought you were going to leave Ellis to me.

13:49.590 --> 13:51.850
I changed my mind.

14:14.880 --> 14:16.410
Ellis.

14:19.090 --> 14:21.320
Ellis?!

14:21.320 --> 14:23.050
Nadie...

14:30.260 --> 14:33.200
I shouldn't have left things...

14:33.200 --> 14:35.240
...to you...

14:35.240 --> 14:38.340
...to the policemen...

14:38.340 --> 14:41.310
Humans are weak creatures.

14:41.310 --> 14:43.480
They're weak, so they lean on each other.

14:43.480 --> 14:46.380
Protect each other?

14:46.380 --> 14:49.520
Rubbish.

14:49.520 --> 14:52.390
But you did leave her at one point...

14:52.390 --> 14:54.190
...to a weak creature.

14:54.190 --> 14:55.490
You're wrong.

14:55.490 --> 14:59.030
I did it because I thought
it would be interesting.

14:59.030 --> 15:01.100
I don't know about that.

15:01.100 --> 15:03.390
Maybe the truth is that you were scared.

15:05.270 --> 15:10.200
You didn't want to do something
uncalled for and earn Ellis's hatred.

15:10.200 --> 15:12.640
I'm right, aren't I, L. A?

15:18.450 --> 15:20.970
That's so human.

15:26.950 --> 15:28.920
I won't miss this time!

15:28.920 --> 15:32.980
Are you mad? That's even more human.

15:42.570 --> 15:44.300
Ellis!

15:46.540 --> 15:48.270
Nadie!

15:50.680 --> 15:52.370
Ellis!

16:11.200 --> 16:13.000
Ellis...

16:20.640 --> 16:24.630
If you hurt Nadie, I won't forgive you.

16:28.720 --> 16:31.550
Ellis...

16:31.550 --> 16:35.720
Even when you find out her true identity?

16:35.720 --> 16:37.220
True identity?

16:37.220 --> 16:43.300
That's right. Nadie isn't really
the sort of person you think she is.

16:43.300 --> 16:44.700
L. A!

16:44.700 --> 16:47.500
I'll tell you, Ellis.

16:49.100 --> 16:51.770
You see, Nadie was...

16:51.770 --> 16:57.440
Nadie was hired by an organization,
and that's how she crossed paths with you.

16:57.440 --> 17:00.080
In order to...

17:00.080 --> 17:02.450
...watch you.

17:14.190 --> 17:16.250
Watch me...

17:19.670 --> 17:22.290
Wanna go sit with Mommy and Daddy?

17:43.120 --> 17:45.110
- Nadie!
- Huh?

17:59.370 --> 18:01.170
Ellis...

18:16.560 --> 18:19.530
That's good, Ellis.

18:22.230 --> 18:23.720
Ellis!

18:28.170 --> 18:29.760
L. A...

18:39.210 --> 18:43.320
- Ellis.
- Nadie...

18:43.320 --> 18:44.820
Ellis...

18:44.820 --> 18:46.680
Nadie...

18:48.120 --> 18:52.430
Ellis... I...

18:52.430 --> 18:54.630
Nadie.

18:54.630 --> 18:56.430
Ellis...

19:18.490 --> 19:20.250
Wait.

19:23.360 --> 19:26.260
I'm sorry.

19:26.260 --> 19:29.490
But Nadie is Nadie.

19:31.270 --> 19:36.370
That's enough... for me.

19:36.370 --> 19:40.640
I'll take you at least as far as Wiñay Marka.

19:40.640 --> 19:44.840
Let's end this already, L.A.

19:53.650 --> 19:55.450
This thing...

19:59.930 --> 20:02.830
See you later, Ellis.

20:27.290 --> 20:29.690
We missed our opportunity this time.

20:29.690 --> 20:31.560
You have my apologies.

20:31.560 --> 20:33.620
Next time, we will not fail.

20:57.550 --> 21:00.390
It's me.

21:00.390 --> 21:02.510
Today's report, please.

21:25.010 --> 21:28.320
Nadie...

21:28.320 --> 21:30.620
Thank you...

21:30.620 --> 21:32.490
...for saving me.

21:32.490 --> 21:35.620
It's okay...

21:35.620 --> 21:38.520
It's okay now...

22:19.630 --> 22:24.440
Even artificial life forms come to
have the capacity for emotions.

22:24.440 --> 22:27.970
And to that fact, there are...

22:27.970 --> 22:29.770
...no exceptions.

22:36.550 --> 22:40.350
Owaranai natsu no you ni

22:40.350 --> 22:43.790
Chiranai hana no you ni

22:43.790 --> 22:47.690
Dakishimeta sono ude o

22:47.690 --> 22:55.830
Zutto hanasanaide ite yo

23:02.040 --> 23:05.650
Sugari-tsuite-mitemo

23:05.650 --> 23:11.450
Mune wa mada chigau hakanasa de

23:11.450 --> 23:15.420
Toki no rizumu kazoeteru

23:15.420 --> 23:19.530
Akai hoshi no yoru

23:19.530 --> 23:23.530
Kiete-yuku nukumori

23:23.530 --> 23:27.470
Tsunagi-tometai no yo

23:27.470 --> 23:33.870
Hitomi tojita kimi o

23:33.870 --> 23:37.840
Akogare o kuri-kaeshi

23:37.840 --> 23:41.180
Doko e mo yukenaku-temo

23:41.180 --> 23:45.420
Setsunasa no tachidomaru

23:45.420 --> 23:51.730
Kono hito-toki ga futari no

23:51.730 --> 23:56.720
Subete yo
